  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" class=\"rte\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">We revolutionize car care with powerful, no-contact drying for a scratch-free, spotless finish in minutes. Say goodbye to towels&mdash;protect your paint, save time, and dry like a pro!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-start;\" role=\"list\" class=\"list-unstyled list-social footer__list-social\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" class=\"list-social__item\"></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Hyper Blower Pro</strong>&nbsp;isn&rsquo;t just a tool&mdash;it&rsquo;s an essential upgrade for anyone who takes pride in their vehicle. Forget towels that scratch and leave water spots.</p>\r\n<p>This&nbsp;<strong>high-powered, no-contact blower</strong>&nbsp;delivers a flawless, streak-free finish in minutes. With an industry-leading&nbsp;<strong>130 m/s wind speed</strong>, it effortlessly dries your car, removes dust, and clears snow with precision and ease. Powered by a&nbsp;<strong>16000 mAh battery</strong>, it runs up to&nbsp;<strong>15 minutes at max speed</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>recharges in just 1.5 hours.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sleek, powerful, and built for true car enthusiasts, this is&nbsp;<strong>the premium detailing tool</strong> your vehicle deserves. Elevate your car care routine - get yours today</p>",
